# target" (CR 701.21a, 603.4). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with an Ornithopter and, on turn 3, an Authority of the Consuls, then
# sacrifices both to it: only a creature or enchantment other than the Skinripper may be (not itself, a Mox or a land), and
